    <title>Physical Exam</title>
    <text><paragraph>Vital signs recorded on 2026-02-17; see the referring visit&apos;s Vital Signs section. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>General</td><td>Pale; pulse 90, blood pressure 112/70</td></tr><tr><td>Lymph nodes</td><td>No inguinal or supraclavicular nodes</td></tr><tr><td>Pelvic</td><td>With her consent and a chaperone: a friable exophytic tumor about 4.5 cm across replacing the cervix; colposcopy of the vagina shows no spread to the vaginal walls; on rectovaginal examination the left parametrium is thickened and nodular but does not reach the pelvic wall; the right parametrium and the rectal mucosa are free</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

